  "title": {
    "zh": "DIY插珠儿童帐篷城堡拼搭套装",
    "en": "DIY Kids Fort Castle Building Set"
  },
  "summary": {
    "zh": "这是一款儿童DIY插珠帐篷城堡拼搭套装，支持围绕帐篷、通道和互动空间进行多形态搭建，适用于家庭、课堂和活动场景。\n\n品牌为尧顺，产地中国东莞，内帐材料PP，支持反复拆装和创意重构。",
    "en": "This is a kids DIY bead-and-rod fort castle building set that supports multiple layout forms for tents, tunnels, and interactive spaces in family, classroom, and event scenarios.\n\nBrand: Yaoshun. Origin: Dongguan, China. The inner-tent material is PP, and the set supports repeated assembly and creative reconfiguration."
  },
  "description": {
    "zh": [
      "该款DIY插珠儿童帐篷城堡拼搭套装以模块化结构搭建为核心，孩子可围绕城堡、帐篷和通道主题自由组合，形成持续的创意互动玩法。",
      "产品适用于亲子互动、课堂教具和室内外活动空间搭建，可用于空间认知、协作训练与动手实践场景，支持多次拆装重复使用。",
      "包装提供体积、重量与规格参数，便于渠道陈列、仓配管理和项目采购，适合长期供货协同。"
    ],
    "en": [
      "This DIY kids fort castle building set is based on a modular construction structure, allowing children to freely build castle, tent, and tunnel themes for continuous creative interaction.",
      "It is suitable for parent-child interaction, classroom props, and indoor/outdoor play-space setup, supporting spatial learning, collaboration training, and hands-on practice with repeatable assembly.",
      "Packaging includes volume, weight, and specification data for channel display, warehouse operations, and project procurement, making it suitable for long-term supply coordination."
    ]
  },
